### CATS Data Model
* **Presentation:** [2.3 CATS Data Model](https://datatracker.ietf.org/meeting/127/materials/slides-127-cats-23-cats-data-model-01)
* **Presenter:** Presenter from China Mobile
* **Document:** `draft-ietf-cats-data-model`

The presenter summarized recent updates to `draft-ietf-cats-data-model` following its adoption as a working group draft:
* Added a `notification-interval` leaf (default 10 seconds) to prevent notification flooding during flapping.
* Converted `source-type` and `metric-type` from enumerations to `identityref` for better extensibility.
* Split notification events into metric-limited and flow-limited notifications.
* Added an Operational Considerations section describing how the model operates alongside existing YANG forwarding models.

**Discussion:**
* Chong Li inquired about implementation status. The presenter noted early experimental testbed work implementing interfaces between CATS components using the YANG model. Chong Li recommended requesting further feedback from vendors and operators.
* Liu Peng noted that providing documented rationale for specific parameter defaults (e.g., the 10-second notification interval) would be beneficial.

